<ModOps>

	<!-- Oriental Lighthouse monument: IAAM's lighthouse models (buildings/orient/lighthouse) as construction stages.
	     Free: no build cost and no goods; each stage is 4 microphases x 5 s, so all three take 1 minute. Then the completed lighthouse
	     with one socket for the mod's beacon items (allocation Mod14); assets_lighthouse_beacons.xml buffs the beacon's
	     ship type everywhere. All four use mod template MonumentColony_ItemSocket (templates.xml), like vanilla's airship
	     hangar, so each upgrade is a plain GUID change and the monument UI shows 4 phases.
	     One per island: BuildingUnique TourismMonument (Area) on every stage and the completed one; the
	     island-threshold triggers that did this before looped and are retired.
	     Harbour placement like the harbour tower 1404004801: Water_Including_Coast, Orient (New World) quay, QuayArea over the
	     whole BuildBlocker in the stage .ifo files, terrain-height adaption off in the cfgs. -->

