	<!-- completed: same template as the stages (MonumentColony_ItemSocket), like vanilla's completed airship hangar:
	     GUIType Guildhouse shows the socket; ItemContainer + Culture (CultureType Culture, as on the HarborOffice it
	     used to be) carry the item sets; the socketed item itself affects nothing here. The Monument block makes it the
	     monument UI's 4th phase, exactly like the airship hangar's 636: icon 500417/500421 (the mosque's complete) and
	     ProgressbarHeight 150 (without it, default 0, the phase is left out: "Phase 2/3"). The demolish popup comes
	     from the template. Variation 0 = lit, spinning beacon (what the last stage completes into, BuildModeStartVariation 0
	     instead of random); variation 1 = beacon dark and still, switchable like residences via AllowChangeVariation. -->
